      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "strong": true,
                    "text": "Radiocarbon Dating"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "wpz3hkc2t7z84cp",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "A tiny piece of paper (produced from formerly living plant matter) taken from the Dead Sea Scrolls has an activity of 10.8 disintegrations per minute per gram of carbon. If the initial C-14 activity was 13.6 disintegrations/min/g of C, estimate the age of the Dead Sea Scrolls."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "0rj18n6k0p7p854",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "The rate of decay (number of disintegrations/minute/gram of carbon) is proportional to the amount of radioactive C-14 left in the paper, so we can substitute the rates for the amounts, "
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "N"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ", in the relationship:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "1l9e7obe67ea9rh",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "3q70hq2mwo0hxuj",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "mezpgmzc2z2u99h",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "t\\;=\\;-\\frac1\\lambda\\ln\\;\\left(\\frac{N_t}{N_0}\\right)\\;\\rightarrow\\;t\\;=\\;-\\frac1\\lambda\\ln\\;\\left(\\frac{{\\mathrm{Rate}}_t}{{\\mathrm{Rate}}_0}\\right)",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "where the subscript 0 represents the time when the plants were cut to make the paper, and the subscript "
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "t"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " represents the current time."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "lbuq1y46bxfwhz9",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "The decay constant can be determined from the half-life of C-14, 5730 years:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "a79nzj4pue414ni",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "3w8bryhmvzva1ss",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "c1rvu2mh3j0pihi",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "\\lambda\\;=\\;\\frac{\\ln\\;2}{t_{1/2}}\\;=\\;\\frac{0.693}{5730\\;\\mathrm y}\\;=\\;1.21\\;\\times\\;10^{-4}\\;\\mathrm y^{-1}",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Substituting and solving, we have:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "db7mxe6i2hwe8ze",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "6llcruo01bhfdya",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "1xvujl41dxx3eq0",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "t\\;=\\;-\\frac1\\lambda\\ln\\;\\left(\\frac{{\\mathrm{Rate}}_t}{{\\mathrm{Rate}}_0}\\right)\\;=\\;-\\frac1{1.21\\;\\times\\;10^{-4}\\;\\mathrm y^{-1}}\\ln\\;\\left(\\frac{10.8\\;\\mathrm{dis}/\\min/\\mathrm g\\;\\mathrm C}{13.6\\;\\mathrm{dis}/\\min/\\mathrm g\\;\\mathrm C}\\right)\\;=\\;1910\\;\\mathrm y",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Therefore, the Dead Sea Scrolls (shown below) are approximately 1900 years old."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "0ebb49vjeab78o0",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "alt": "A photograph of six pages of ragged-edged paper covered in writing are shown.",
                "caption": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "em": true,
                        "text": "Carbon-14 dating has shown that these pages from the Dead Sea Scrolls were written or copied on paper made from plants that died between 100 BC and AD 50."
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "p"
                  }
                ],
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "h74fdloadqric70",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "rp895svopaa0077",
                "src": "https://d2xvti2irp4c7t.cloudfront.net/media/5f/5f6f1ba59a504083b1adbbf415590595/dead_sea_scroll.jfif",
                "type": "img",
                "width": "500"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": ""
                  }
                ],
                "id": "3461269481",
                "type": "p"
              }
            ],
            "id": "2681721932",
