      },
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "strong": true,
                    "text": "Radioactive Dating of Rocks"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "0i3693xo8x90mo8",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "An igneous rock contains 9.58 × 10"
                  },
                  {
                    "sup": true,
                    "text": "−5"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " g of U-238 and 2.51 × 10"
                  },
                  {
                    "sup": true,
                    "text": "−5"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " g of Pb-206 and much, much smaller amounts of Pb-208. Determine the approximate time at which the rock formed."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "sdh8a6u8sjgn38f",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "The sample of rock contains very little Pb-208, the most common isotope of lead, so we can safely assume that all the Pb-206 in the rock was produced by the radioactive decay of U-238. When the rock formed, it contained all of the U-238 currently in it, plus some U-238 that has since undergone radioactive decay."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "c5nivfmhchilkdi",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "The amount of U-238 currently in the rock is:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "c3zyw0ucj0zmdpa",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "smhoe8a0ge7qpz7",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "oif3dp1c8glbxnz",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "\\require{cancel}9.58\\;\\times\\;10^{-5}\\;\\cancel{\\mathrm{gU}}\\;\\times\\;\\left(\\frac{1\\;\\mathrm{mol}\\;\\mathrm U}{238\\;\\cancel{\\mathrm g\\;\\mathrm U}}\\right)\\;=\\;4.03\\;\\times\\;10^{-7}\\;\\mathrm{mol}\\;\\mathrm U",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Because when one mole of U-238 decays, it produces one mole of Pb-206, the amount of U-238 that has undergone radioactive decay since the rock was formed is:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "ydqf3kxh4793kmh",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "zgeme9ulj5m0ji1",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "1cwkokewc6b8st3",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "\\require{cancel}2.51\\;\\times\\;10^{-5}\\;\\cancel{\\mathrm g\\;\\mathrm{Pb}}\\;\\times\\;\\left(\\frac{1\\;\\cancel{\\mathrm{mol}\\;\\mathrm{Pb}}}{206\\;\\cancel{\\mathrm g\\;\\mathrm{Pb}}}\\right)\\;\\times\\;\\left(\\frac{1\\;\\mathrm{mol}\\;\\mathrm U}{1\\;\\cancel{\\mathrm{mol}\\;\\mathrm{Pb}}}\\right)\\;=\\;1.22\\;\\times\\;10^{-7}\\;\\mathrm{mol}",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "The total amount of U-238 originally present in the rock is therefore:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "wvqi8p734garlrp",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "suxljss5dfpo69c",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "u0j25eyzq24ltkd",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "4.03\\; \\times\\;10^{-7}\\;\\mathrm{mol} \\;+\\;1.22\\;\\times\\;10^{-7}\\; \\mathrm{mol} \\;=\\;5.25\\;\\times \\;10^{-7}\\;\\mathrm{mol}\\;\\mathrm U",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "The amount of time that has passed since the formation of the rock is given by:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "bw83ysbvwsalr4a",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "z0qq0nuaec8rfhg",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "m3bsieo8avs938r",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "t\\;=\\;-\\frac1\\lambda\\ln\\;\\left(\\frac{N_t}{N_0}\\right)",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "with "
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "N"
                  },
                  {
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "0"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " representing the original amount of U-238 and "
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "N"
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "t"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " representing the present amount of U-238."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "j0xzuwvao7u127f",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "U-238 decays into Pb-206 with a half-life of 4.5 × 10"
                  },
                  {
                    "sup": true,
                    "text": "9"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " y, so the decay constant "
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": ""
                      }
                    ],
                    "legacyBlockRendered": false,
                    "src": "\\lambda",
                    "subtype": "latex",
                    "type": "formula_inline"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " is:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "v2pf65gp92b0ysm",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "wlhmwzgwvfufr3r",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "i40e3s077q4wjk4",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "\\lambda\\;=\\;\\frac{\\ln\\;2}{t_{1/2}}\\;=\\;\\frac{0.693}{4.5\\;\\times\\;10^9\\;\\mathrm y}\\;=\\;1.54\\;\\times\\;10^{-10}\\;\\mathrm y^{-1}",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Substituting and solving, we have:"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "3v1ghkl665x0tsm",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "c8sz3dldvc9xe6j",
                    "text": " ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "yo08wbz4jkd5nln",
                "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
                "src": "\\require{cancel}t\\;=\\;-\\frac1{1.54\\;\\times\\;10^{-10}\\;\\mathrm y^{-1}}\\;\\ln\\;\\left(\\frac{4.03\\;\\times\\;10^{-7}\\;\\cancel{\\mathrm{mol}\\;\\mathrm U}}{5.25\\;\\times\\;10^{-7}\\;\\cancel{\\mathrm{mol}\\;\\mathrm U}}\\right)\\;=\\;1.7\\;\\times\\;10^9\\;\\mathrm y",
                "subtype": "latex",
                "type": "formula"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Therefore, the rock is approximately 1.7 billion years old."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "1wew36jdgkzc8w7",
                "type": "p"
              }
            ],
